1069| * `dir/game/`'s sources and `dir/screenshots/`'s PNG and JPEG files (names starting with '.' skipped). `images` are
1070| * the screenshots in name order, the first the cover; `text` is a "## Game" block (the source, vendored and asset
1071| * counts and the totals) then "## Sources", index.html first, then the source JS files in importOrder's order,
1072| * then the other source files by path, each under a
1073| * header line naming its path, lines and bytes and then its text in a fence. The text holds at most
1074| * `caps.text_max_bytes` UTF-8 bytes: every source that fits goes in whole, in that order; the first that does not
1075| * goes in up to its last complete line that fits (its fence closed, then a line naming how many of its lines are not
1076| * shown), or not at all when not one line fits; nothing follows it but a last line naming how many whole files and
1077| * how many bytes of source were left out. Throws DossierError on a game tree it cannot read or one past a cap
1078| * (readGameTree), a missing game/index.html, screenshots no dossier can hold, a text cap that cannot hold the Game
